# TURN relay for P2P games. Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in ONE option.
# Values are baked into the client bundle at build time — rebuild after changing them.
# Get credentials at https://dashboard.metered.ca → TURN Server.

# Option A (recommended): Metered credentials API. Fetched when a P2P game starts,
# so keys can be rotated/limited in the dashboard without rebuilding.
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIALS_URL=https://<app>.metered.live/api/v1/turn/credentials?apiKey=<apikey>

# Option B: static credentials from the dashboard.
# VITE_TURN_URLS=turn:global.relay.metered.ca:80,turn:global.relay.metered.ca:80?transport=tcp,turn:global.relay.metered.ca:443,turns:global.relay.metered.ca:443?transport=tcp
# VITE_TURN_USERNAME=
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
